## Round r2

- Status: in progress (part 1 of 2 done).
- Root cause of the K4 invalid JSON: the splice in `setWordClips` dropped the
  `"audio": {` opening line of each block, so the audio keys merged into the book object.
  The new text then failed with "Expected ',' or ']' after array element".
- Fix: `body.slice(0, -1)` keeps the opening line; the closing line comes from `edited.slice(block.end)`.
